# Generated artifacts are compared byte-for-byte by their `--check` gates.
# Pin LF in the working tree so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) cannot
# make a fresh checkout look like a stale artifact that is not stale. This is
# the `[7]` line-endings gap: the check compares the generated bytes against
# the checked-out file, and autocrlf would rewrite the latter to CRLF.
docs/support-matrix.md text eol=lf
/docs/*.tsv text eol=lf
